{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30561","headline":"将归宜春留题新安馆 · 卢肇","name":"将归宜春留题新安馆","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东里如今号郑乡，西家昔日近丘墙。\n芸台四部添新学，秘殿三年学老郎。\n天外鸳鸾愁不见，山中云鹤喜相忘。\n犹张皂盖归蓬荜，直谓时无许子将。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢肇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30561.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30561","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}